#: game/rules/hands.gd:22
msgid "Three pieces of the same color (Prism counts as any color). Every placement from this tray gets x2 Mult."
msgstr "三個同顏色的拼塊(稜鏡視為任意顏色)。來自這個托盤的每次放置獲得x2倍率。"

#: game/rules/hands.gd:23
msgid "+1 PLACEMENT"
msgstr "+1次放置"

#: game/rules/hands.gd:23
msgid "STAIRS"
msgstr "階梯"

#: game/rules/hands.gd:23
msgid "Staircase"
msgstr "階梯"

#: game/rules/hands.gd:24
msgid "Cell counts in a row, like 2-3-4. You gain +1 placement (it can go above your refill cap)."
msgstr "格數連續,例如2-3-4。獲得+1次放置(可以超過補充上限)。"

#: game/rules/hands.gd:25
